;; Verified public-register citations for the legal entity archived by this repository.
;;
;; Every row is checked live by tools/verify_citations.cljk:
;;   * GET :cite/url must answer HTTP 2xx
;;   * :cite/expect-substring must appear in the response body
;;
;; A URL that cannot be fetched, or whose body no longer carries the claim, is a
;; DRIFT and fails the gate. Nothing is recorded here that was not retrieved
;; (all rows were fetched and byte-matched on 2026-08-22).
;;
;; FOUR independent voices are cited, not one:
;;   * GLEIF, the global LEI system (api.gleif.org) -- including its resolution
;;     of registration authority RA000412 (the Legal Affairs Bureau / 法務局,
;;     Japan's commercial register), of entity legal form T417 (株式会社,
;;     kabusiki gaisya), and of the managing LOU -- which for this record is
;;     株式会社東京証券取引所, Tokyo Stock Exchange, Inc. itself
;;   * the National Tax Agency (国税庁), at its Corporate Number Publication
;;     Site (houjin-bangou.nta.go.jp) -- the state's own per-entity page for
;;     corporate number 3180001017428, which also carries the designation date
;;     and the official reading (フリガナ) the other voices do not have
;;   * gBizINFO (info.gbiz.go.jp), the Ministry of Economy, Trade and
;;     Industry's cross-ministry corporate-information aggregator, printing the
;;     same name, number, and head-office address from a separately operated
;;     service
;;   * the issuer itself, at www.chuden.co.jp -- the privacy-policy page this
;;     repository archives (80-data/public/tos.journal.edn archives
;;     https://www.chuden.co.jp/privacy/, the same URL row issuer-privacy-title
;;     cites), its company-outline page, and its IR top page
;;
;; HOW THE TWO REGISTRY NUMBERS RELATE (so a reader does not count one voice
;; twice). GLEIF names RA000412 -- Companies Registration (登記) operated by
;; the Legal Affairs Bureau (法務局) -- as both register of record and
;; validation authority, and records registeredAs 1800-01-017428, the
;; 会社法人等番号 (company registration number) in the registry's own
;; XXXX-XX-XXXXXX rendering. The National Tax Agency's 法人番号 (corporate
;; number) 3180001017428 is, by the NTA's published construction, a single
;; check digit (3) prefixed to those same 12 digits with the hyphens removed
;; (180001017428). So rows gleif-registered-as / gleif-validated-as /
;; gleif-ocid and rows nta-corporate-number / gbiz-corporate-number corroborate
;; one underlying commercial-registry identity through two different state
;; renderings of it -- and GLEIF's OpenCorporates id jp/3180001017428 prints
;; the NTA-form number inside the GLEIF body itself.
;;
;; SIX HONEST WRINKLES, SO A READER DOES NOT MISREAD THEM AS DRIFT:
;;   1. GLEIF's creationDate "1951-04-30T15:00:00Z" (row gleif-creation-date)
;;      and the issuer's founding date 1951年（昭和26年）5月1日 (row
;;      issuer-profile-founded) are the SAME instant -- UTC rendering of Tokyo
;;      midnight, JST being UTC+9. Not a disagreement.
;;   2. The English name arrives in THREE renderings that are one name: GLEIF's
;;      alternative-language legal name "Chubu Electric Power Co., Inc." (row
;;      gleif-legal-name-en), the issuer's own company-outline rendering
;;      "Chubu Electric Power Company,Incorporated" (row issuer-profile-name-en,
;;      no space after the comma -- cited exactly as the page prints it), and
;;      the README's "Chubu Electric Power Company, Inc.", which no row below
;;      asserts. The registered name is the Japanese one; English is decoration
;;      each voice renders its own way.
;;   3. The head-office address arrives in three renderings that are one
;;      place: GLEIF ja 東新町１番地 (full-width １; row gleif-legal-address),
;;      NTA / gBizINFO 愛知県名古屋市東区東新町１番地 (full-width １; rows
;;      nta-head-office, gbiz-head-office), and the issuer's
;;      名古屋市東区東新町1番地 (half-width 1; row issuer-profile-address).
;;      GLEIF's English alternative address "1, Higashi-shincho" (row
;;      gleif-legal-address-en) and postal code 461-8680 (rows
;;      gleif-postal-code, issuer-profile-postal) tie them together.
;;   4. The GLEIF JSON body serves non-ASCII as literal \uXXXX escapes, so the
;;      Japanese-text GLEIF rows below match those escape sequences (written in
;;      this EDN with doubled backslashes), while the NTA / gBizINFO / issuer
;;      pages serve raw UTF-8 and their rows match the characters directly.
;;      Two encodings, one legal name.
;;   5. The two nta-* provenance rows (nta-designation-date, nta-furigana) are
;;      the NTA page's unique voice: the corporate number's designation date
;;      平成27年10月5日 (2015-10-05, when the corporate-number system assigned
;;      numbers to existing companies -- NOT a founding date; see wrinkle 1)
;;      and the official katakana reading チュウブデンリョク. Unlike the
;;      neighbouring Tokyo Gas record in this catalog family, this NTA page
;;      carries no merger history rows -- its change history is name/address
;;      metadata only (last updated 平成30年4月6日). An absence, not a drift.
;;   6. Rows issuer-ir-ticker-link / issuer-ir-venue-label assert exactly what
;;      the issuer's IR top page carries server-side: a quote link to the
;;      Tokyo Stock Exchange's stock search with code 9502, labelled
;;      株価情報（東京証券取引所）. They do NOT assert the README's market
;;      segment claim "TSE Prime" -- no row below does. The deeper venue
;;      connection is GLEIF's: the managing LOU of this very LEI record is
;;      Tokyo Stock Exchange, Inc. itself (rows gleif-managing-lou, lou-lei,
;;      lou-legal-name-en).

